#
# Fail-witness for ex:saActingGroupHasNoGlobalAxiom: a functional characteristic on
# math:actingGroup. Under the reasoner it would make two actors of one action the same
# individual, so a subgroup and the full group would be identified instead of reported.
@prefix math:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .

math:actingGroupFunctionality a logic:PropertyCharacteristicAssertion ;
    logic:characterizes math:actingGroup ;
    logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty .
